{"id":"f80881be5f44d233","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-np-intermediate.md","title":"df-np-intermediate (NP-Intermediate Languages)","display":"df-np-intermediate (NP-Intermediate Languages)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-np-intermediate","display":"df-np-intermediate (NP-Intermediate Languages)","depends_on":["[[28-df-p]]","[[28-df-np]]","[[28-df-np-complete]]"],"aliases":["28-df-np-intermediate","NP-intermediate","NP-Intermediate Languages"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-np-intermediate"},{"key":"display","html":"df-np-intermediate (NP-Intermediate Languages)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd9febae42d44280\" href=\"?note=dd9febae42d44280\" title=\"28-df-p\">28-df-p</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0cb5248561455df8\" href=\"?note=0cb5248561455df8\" title=\"28-df-np\">28-df-np</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7a9125ebbfdef91e\" href=\"?note=7a9125ebbfdef91e\" title=\"28-df-np-complete\">28-df-np-complete</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-np-intermediate</span><span>NP-intermediate</span><span>NP-Intermediate Languages</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NP}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)\">\\(\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NP}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\subseteq\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\subseteq\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span> uses polynomial-time many-one reductions</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NPI}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)\">\\(\\mathbf{NPI}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NPI}\\coloneqq\n\\mathbf{NP}\\setminus\\bigl(\\mathbf P\\cup\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{NPI}\\coloneqq\n\\mathbf{NP}\\setminus\\bigl(\\mathbf P\\cup\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>等价地，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathbf{NPI}\">\\(L\\in\\mathbf{NPI}\\)</span> 要求 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(L\\in\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\notin\\mathbf P\">\\(L\\notin\\mathbf P\\)</span> 且非 NP 完全；存在这样的语言由 Ladner 定理在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P\\ne\\mathbf{NP}\">\\(\\mathbf P\\ne\\mathbf{NP}\\)</span> 前提下保证。</p>\n<p>来源核对：定理3.3及其前述说明；印刷71页；PDF97页。条件性与排除P、NP完全性的定义已核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-p","status":"resolved","id":"dd9febae42d44280","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-p]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np","status":"resolved","id":"0cb5248561455df8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-np-complete","status":"resolved","id":"7a9125ebbfdef91e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-np-complete]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf P,\\mathbf{NP}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\subseteq\\mathbf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NPI}\\subseteq\\mathcal P(\\{0,1\\}^*)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NPI}\\coloneqq\n\\mathbf{NP}\\setminus\\bigl(\\mathbf P\\cup\\mathrm{NPComplete}\\bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathbf{NPI}","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathbf{NP}","display":false},{"tex":"L\\notin\\mathbf P","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P\\ne\\mathbf{NP}","display":false}],"bytes":1031,"backlinks":[{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-67","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"NP 中间问题：[[28-df-np-intermediate]]、[[28-thm-ladner]]。"},{"id":"82a3c01529a680bd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["dd9febae42d44280","0cb5248561455df8","7a9125ebbfdef91e"]}